### Page 0 of the open tasks, 3 per page, soonest due first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?done=false&page=0&size=3&sort=dueDate,asc

### Filter by priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?priority=HIGH

### One task with its project and tags
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2

### Overdue tasks (derived query)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/overdue

### Count per priority (JPQL projection)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/stats

### Projects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects

### Tasks of project 1 (JOIN FETCH)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/tasks

### Create a project
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Capstone", "description": "Team project" }

### Create a task with tags
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Write the ERD", "priority": "HIGH", "projectId": 1, "estimateHours": 3, "tags": ["Design", "urgent"] }

### Unknown project: 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Lost task", "priority": "LOW", "projectId": 999 }

### Update (no save() call in the service: dirty checking)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Move the API to PostgreSQL", "priority": "HIGH", "done": true, "estimateHours": 4 }

### Complete
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/4/complete

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/5
